      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.32,
      "end_seconds": 6.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting, come in. Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.71,
      "end_seconds": 11.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I'm here because of severe lower back pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.37,
      "end_seconds": 16.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.42,
      "end_seconds": 21.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I've had it since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.79,
      "end_seconds": 26.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.33,
      "end_seconds": 28.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.16,
      "end_seconds": 32.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Any fever or recent fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.9,
      "end_seconds": 35.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.81,
      "end_seconds": 41.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "what about your tummy and and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.39,
      "end_seconds": 45.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.11,
      "end_seconds": 50.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.93,
      "end_seconds": 54.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "right, my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.77,
      "end_seconds": 70.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.13,
      "end_seconds": 88.04,
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. No, I share a house with my brother. I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.5,
      "end_seconds": 95.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.9,
      "end_seconds": 98.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.49,
      "end_seconds": 105.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.03,
      "end_seconds": 112.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.41,
      "end_seconds": 114.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.51,
      "end_seconds": 133.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.42,
      "end_seconds": 137.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.0,
      "end_seconds": 144.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.75,
      "end_seconds": 152.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "I'm on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.79,
      "end_seconds": 166.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.59,
      "end_seconds": 181.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.48,
      "end_seconds": 215.55,
      "duration_seconds": 16.07,
      "text": "Okay: height 152 centimetres, weight 95 kilos, BP is 113 over 69. And temperature is 36.7 degrees, BMI works out to 41.1, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse is 73 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.55,
      "end_seconds": 222.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "right, let's have a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.79,
      "end_seconds": 230.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.92,
      "end_seconds": 234.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.36,
      "end_seconds": 247.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "You have numbness in the saddle area and your leg strength is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.76,
      "end_seconds": 260.79,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "all finished, thank you. Let me tell you where I've got to. The most likely explanation is possible cauda equina syndrome needing an urgent scan"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.05,
      "end_seconds": 264.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.37,
      "end_seconds": 288.68,
      "duration_seconds": 23.31,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible cauda equina syndrome needing an urgent scan, and we'll know more once the an urgent MRI of the spine is back. an urgent MRI of the spine is what I'd like next, for possible cauda equina."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.09,
      "end_seconds": 291.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.83,
      "end_seconds": 302.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "You need to go to hospital now for an emergency scan. I'm going to send a referral to the spinal team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.48,
      "end_seconds": 304.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.08,
      "end_seconds": 310.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Let's review you straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.06,
      "end_seconds": 319.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Alright, uh, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
